{"title":"Career Roadmap · Loan Officer","role":"Loan Officer","summary":"A Loan Officer evaluates loan applications, assesses borrower eligibility and repayment capacity, verifies documentation, coordinates credit processing, and supports customers through the lending process.","facts":{},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Career Overview"},{"type":"p","text":"A Loan Officer evaluates loan applications, assesses borrower eligibility and repayment capacity, verifies documentation, coordinates credit processing, and supports customers through the lending process."},{"type":"p","text":"A BBA in Banking & Insurance provides a strong foundation because the programme typically covers banking operations, finance, accounting, insurance, economics, risk management and financial services."},{"type":"flow","items":["The role combines credit analysis","customer interaction","documentation","risk assessment","compliance."],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"A strong progression is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Banking fundamentals","Credit operations","Loan processing","Credit assessment","Risk analysis","Portfolio management"]}]},{"heading":"Career Horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Period","Career Focus"],"rows":[[{"text":"2026–2030"},{"text":"Build banking, lending, accounting, credit and financial-analysis skills"}],[{"text":"2030–2035"},{"text":"Work as Loan Officer / Credit Executive / Credit Analyst"}],[{"text":"2035–2040"},{"text":"Progress toward Senior Credit Officer / Relationship Manager / Credit Manager"}],[{"text":"2040–2046"},{"text":"Move toward Branch Credit Manager, Regional Credit Manager, Credit Risk leadership or Lending Operations leadership"}]]}]},{"heading":"What to Build During BBA – Banking & Insurance","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Year 1 — Banking & Financial Foundation"},{"type":"p","text":"Build strong fundamentals in:"},{"type":"h